evices</li><li>4x Gigabit LAN ports + 1x WAN port</li><li>Smart parental controls &amp; guest network access</li><li>Easy setup with Netgear Nighthawk App</li></ul><p><br></p><p><b>Ideal for: </b>Homes with multiple devices, HD video streaming, online gaming, and smart home setups.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Ruijie RG-EW1300G AC1300 Mbps Gigabit Dual-Band Mesh Wi-Fi 5 Router","href":"/ruijie-rg-ew1300g-ac1300-mbps-gigabit-dual-band-mesh-wi-fi-5-router","now":"3,790৳","old":"4,090৳","single":""},{"name":"Wi-Tek WI-AX1800M V2 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz 1800Mbps Wireless Mesh Route","href":"/wi-tek-wi-ax1800m-v2-24-ghz-and-5-ghz-1800mbps-wireless-mesh-route","now":"7,500৳","old":"8,100৳","single":""},{"name":"Wi-Tek WI-R3 1200M Dual Band Wireless PoE Switch / Router","href":"/wi-tek-wi-r3-1200m-dual-band-wireless-poe-switch-router","now":"6,800৳","old":"7,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Grandstream GWN7052 1270Mbps Dual Band Gigabit WiFi Router","href":"/grandstream-gwn7052-1270mbps-dual-band-gigabit-wifi-router","now":"6,300৳","old":"6,800৳","single":""},{"name":"Netgear Orbi RBK352 WiFi 6 AX1800 Dual Band Mesh System","href":"/netgear-orbi-rbk352-wifi-6-ax1800-dual-band-mesh-system","now":"","old":"","single":"38,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/netgear-gs108e-8-port-gigabit-plus-managed-desktop-switch","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Netgear%20GS108E/Netgear%20GS108E%208-Port%20Gigabit%20Plus%20Managed%20Desktop%20Switch-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Netgear GS108E 8-Port Gigabit Plus Managed Desktop Switch","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Netgear GS108E 8-Port Gigabit Plus Managed Desktop Switch","now":"4,400৳","old":"5,200৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Ta